      "impact": "github:create-approval-record is a declared application authorization but is absent from every provider permission applicationActionsExact list. The harness still reports the mapping check green because it proves only that each provider permission has some known action. The oracle therefore cannot determine whether approval-record writes are unsupported or whether GitHub contents:write may be used outside its declared exact purposes.",
